111	inclined-plane         & 20  & $+36.00$ & 55   & 20   & 7 / 0 / 13  \\
112	freeze                 & 20  & $+30.50$ & 55   & 25   & 6 / 0 / 14  \\
113	meas-melt-point        & 20  & $+30.05$ & 55   & 25   & 6 / 0 / 14  \\
114	id-life-stages-2       & 20  & $+30.00$ & 50   & 20   & 6 / 0 / 14  \\
